     <P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 33.6pt; MARGIN: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312>为</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312>深化人才培养模式改革，向初中优秀学生提供更充裕的个性化发展空间，</FONT> 2017年我校继续组织创新班招生，现将方案公布如下：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0pt; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'" class=15><FONT face=黑体>一、招生对象</FONT></SPAN><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0pt; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312>具有绍兴市直初中、越城区属初中（不含孙端、陶堰、富盛三镇初中）注册学籍的</FONT>2017年应届优秀毕业生。</SPAN><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0pt; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'" class=15><FONT face=黑体>二、招生计划</FONT></SPAN><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0pt; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312>招生人数为</FONT>90名。</SPAN><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0pt; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=黑体>三、报名条件及办法</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0pt; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">1．基本条件。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312>身体健康，品行端正，热爱科学，学习能力强，心理素质好，具有较强的创新精神、动手实践能力和学科竞赛特质。各学科均衡发展，学习成绩名列年级前茅</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312>。省级学科竞赛一、二等奖获得者可优先推荐。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0pt; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">2.名额分配。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312>根据初三应届毕业生总数按比例分配各初中学校的报考名额，总报考名额原则上为创新班计划数的</FONT>6—8倍，初中每校的推荐数最多不得超过8倍数的比例名额（具体名额分配详见附件1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312>）</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312>。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0pt; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">3.报名办法。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312>学生自愿报名，初中学校根据预先确定公布的工作方案公平、择优推荐，经公示后，集中统一向我校报名。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0pt; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">4.报名材料</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0pt; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312>（</FONT>1）《2017年绍兴一中创新班招生推荐表》（见附件2，每生需交两张1寸证件照，一张直接贴在表上，另一张制作准考证用）；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0pt; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312>（</FONT>2）身份证或户口本复印件；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0pt; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312>（</FONT>3）浙江省学籍系统打印的学生基本信息表（盖校印）。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0pt; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">5.报名时间地点</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=楷体>。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312>时间：初中学校于</FONT>1月18日前确定推荐名单并公示，1月19日上午将审核后的材料报我校并领取准考证。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
